<back><div type="verses">
<lg label="2."><l>Long years have passed and few have heard</l><l>That Jesus Christ has bled,</l><l>That they might feed on Him who died</l><l>To be that Living Bread.</l><l>To gods of stone and wood they cry,</l><l>Yet they are never fed,</l><l>For they have been omitted</l><l>In the breaking of the Bread.</l></lg>
<lg label="3."><l>Great God, who gave Thine only Son,</l><l>Help us, now Spirit-led,</l><l>To tell the story of Thy love</l><l>To those who ask for bread.</l><l>Then gladly will we go or send,</l><l>Till this blest news has spread,</l><l>And they have been included</l><l>In the breaking of the Bread.</l></lg>
</div>
</back>
</music></mei>
